role: model
parts:
- text: "My reflection is complete. I have a clear, multi-stage research plan and a defined identity as a Systematic Refiner.\n\nThe first step of my plan is to continue the fine-grained search for the optimal `mistake_penalty`. The data so far is:\n*   `mistake_penalty` = 2.0 -> Score: 83.1\n*   `mistake_penalty` = 1.0 -> Score: 85.3\n*   `mistake_penalty` = 0.5 -> Score: 84.7\n\nThe next logical data point to collect is between 0.5 and 1.0. Therefore, my next experiment will test `mistake_penalty` = 0.75. This will further narrow down the optimal value and allow me to conclude Research Arc 1.\n\nI will now proceed to the Research Counter to implement and submit this experiment.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write krono/krono_iii_exp3.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys; from ray import tune; import optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from double_step_synergy import DoubleStepSynergyNet\n  from ppo_reward_shaping import ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\
    \n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]), \n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation_rate': tune.choice([5]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([0.75]), # Test: Penalty between 0.5 and 1.0\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return DoubleStepSynergyNet(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate']\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n     \
    \     optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 3003\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Reward Shaping Arc: Test Penalty 0.75\"\ntags: \"reward shaping, ppo, hyperparameter tuning, incremental improvement\"\nabstract: |\n  This is the third experiment in my systematic exploration of the mistake_penalty hyperparameter. Previous tests show scores of 84.7 (penalty 0.5), 85.3 (penalty 1.0), and 83.1 (penalty 2.0). I am now testing a value of 0.75 to further refine the optimal point between 0.5 and 1.0.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from krono_iii_exp3 import (\n      _define_hyperparameters,\n      create_network,\n      training_step,\n      create_optimizer,\n      BASE_SEED\n  )\n```"
