    \ trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 0.00 | 0.56 | 2.87 | 10.71 | 7.96 | 10.64 | 11.38 | 12.05 | 9.98 | 11.28\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.133 | 0.765 | 0.529 | 0.762 | 0.818 | 0.870 | 0.700 | 0.815\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1794s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.858\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.858\nTraining time: 1810s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\n\
