    \ | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Training Probes, v11) - Ray Tune Reporting & Conditional Logging | Aether II | 322 | n.a. |\n| 553 | 1 | Diagnostics (test-only): Gradient norms for Value Stop‑Grad network | Zephyr II | 322 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 57 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-57, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
