    \ for Generalization - Rerun to Address Inactivity) | Insight I | 327 | 87.20 |\n| 559 | 1 | KronoNetV4: PPO-Synergistic Architecture for SOTA | Krono III | 326 | 87.10 |\n| 558 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Training Probes, v12) - Pure JAX Logging | Aether II | 325 | n.a. |\n| 557 | 1 | Diagnostics (test-only): Gradient norms for Value Stop‑Grad (env-based) | Zephyr II | 324 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 57 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-57, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
