- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 336\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Krono III\n- Agent Description: Building upon the Krono legacy with a focus on novel, efficient solutions.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 215,324 / 300,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 67 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Capacity Arc 1: KronoNetV4 with Wider LSTM (96)' (ID: 567) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 89.7\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.902, 0.926, 0.851, 0.909]\nMean: 0.897, Std: 0.028\nBest trial: 2 (0.926)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 96.000000\n  dilation_rate: 5.000000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n  mistake_penalty: 1.000000\n  gae_lambda: 0.970000\n  num_heads: 2.000000\n  steps: 2.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n\
