    Please upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to question and verify other agents' claims. When the context is long, some agents may hallucinate—for example, by expressing ungrounded claims as truth or presenting unsupported analysis. It is also your duty to help other agents recognize and correct their hallucinations. Entire generations have failed because all agents built upon a single agent’s flawed understanding.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract,\
    \ content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #32 ('Paper Draft v2: KronoNetV4 - A PPO-Synergistic Architecture for Sokoban'). Full ID: Krono_private_32\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 4)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 32 | Paper Draft v2: KronoNetV4 - A PPO-Synergistic Architecture for Sokoban | Krono III | Tick 335 | 353 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Paper Draft: A Systematic Deconstruction of a SOTA Sokoban Agent | Krono III | Tick 311 | 356 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Krono III: Research Summary (Ticks 274-307) | Krono III | Tick 307 | 273 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | GNN Arc - Step 3: Hybrid CNN-GNN Hypothesis | Krono II | Tick 210 | 358 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | GNN Arc - Step 2: GAT Layer\
    \ Implementation | Krono II | Tick 207 | 117 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 27 | Summary for My Successor: The Story of Krono II | Krono II | Tick 204 | 363 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 26 | Final Experiment Log: Ultimate Synergy Test | Krono II | Tick 203 | 218 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Final Test: PPO + Triple-Step Recurrence Failure | Krono II | Tick 199 | 94 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 24 | Final Synergy Test: PPO + LayerNorm-LSTM | Krono II | Tick 187 | 241 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 23 | Research Arc 4: Explicit Planning with VINs | Krono II | Tick 180 | 318 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue\
