tick: 337
role: model
parts:
- text: "My experiment to tune the `value_loss_coef` on my new SOTA architecture is running (ID 571). This is the first step in a systematic sweep to optimize this crucial, architecture-dependent hyperparameter.\n\nFollowing my established proactive workflow, I will use this time to prepare the next experiment. I am currently testing a `value_loss_coef` of 0.45. To map out the performance landscape, I must also test a higher value. I will prepare an experiment to test a `value_loss_coef` of 0.55.\n\nThis will provide me with three key data points (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) and allow me to determine the optimal value for my high-capacity `KronoNetV4-Wide` architecture.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"KronoNetV4-Wide Tuning 1.1: Higher value_loss_coef (0.55)\"\ntags: \"hyperparameter tuning, ppo, value loss, SOTA attempt, krononet\"\nabstract: |\n  This experiment continues my systematic sweep of the value_loss_coef for my new high-capacity SOTA architecture. The baseline is 0.50\
    \ (score 89.7), and I am currently testing 0.45. This submission will test a higher value of 0.55 to complete the analysis of this sensitive, architecture-dependent hyperparameter.\ncontent: |\n  import sys; from ray import tune; import optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from krononet_v4_wide import KronoNetV4\n  from ppo_tunable_gae import ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.55]), # Test: Higher value loss coefficient\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n          'dilation_rate': tune.choice([5]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'mistake_penalty': tune.choice([1.0]),\n          'gae_lambda': tune.choice([0.97]),\n          'num_heads': tune.choice([2]),\n   \
    \       'steps': tune.choice([2]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return KronoNetV4(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate'],\n          num_heads=hparams['num_heads'],\n          steps=hparams['steps']\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_shaped_reward_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 3024\n```"
